        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "Substituting into (48) the vectors  $ \\kappa $ and  $ v_g $ in polar coordinates (44), and let  $ a = |\\kappa|\\Delta $, this yields the propagation angle  $ \\varphi $ and the propagation speed  $ |v_g| $ in terms of  $ a $ and  $ \\theta $.",
          "block_bbox": [
            71,
            1081,
            1008,
            1124
          ],
          "block_id": 13,
          "block_order": 3,
          "group_id": 13,
          "block_polygon_points": [
            [
              71.0,
              1081.0
